|'''''[[Characters of Disney's The Little Mermaid#King Triton|King Triton]]'''''||[[Norm Lewis]]|| The strict but caring father of Ariel, and ruler over Atlantica. He originally hates humans, due to the loss of his wife, causing him to commonly reprimand Ariel for her constant human explorations, but eventually realizes it is best to let her follow her dreams. He is the apparent brother of Ursula.|| [[Baritone]] || [[Jerry Dixon (actor)|Jerry Dixon]], [[Jeff McCarthy]], [[Steve Blanchard]], [[Ben Davis (singer)|Ben Davis]], [[Terrence Mann]], [[Peter Gallagher]], [[Ken Page]]
|-
| '''''[[Characters of Disney's The Little Mermaid#Sebastian|Sebastian]]''''' || [[Tituss Burgess]] || Ariel's musical and practical guardian, Triton's faithful servant, and court composer. He serves as the musical's primary comic relief, and reluctantly assists Ariel in her efforts to charm Prince Eric.|| [[Tenor]] || [[Alan Mingo Jr.]], [[Francis Jue]], [[James T. Lane]], [[Ken Page]], [[Derrick Baskin]]
|-
|'''''[[Characters of Disney's The Little Mermaid#Scuttle|Scuttle]]'''''||[[Eddie Korbich]]|| He believes he is an expert on human artifacts, although he is mainly incorrect, and is often consulted by Ariel for information on her discovered "treasures". He also serves as a comic relief, alongside Sebastian.|| [[Tenor]] || [[Lara Teeter]], [[Tim Federle]]
|-
| '''''[[Characters of Disney's The Little Mermaid#Grimsby|Grimsby]]''''' || [[Jonathan Freeman (actor)|Jonathan Freeman]] || Prince Eric's faithful servant and friend. Seemingly a close friend of Eric's late father, Grimsby's main initiative is to ensure that Eric marries a princess to maintain his promise to the deceased king. He realizes Ariel is a princess, and is more than happy to let them wed.|| [[Baritone]] ||
|-
| '''''[[Characters of Disney's The Little Mermaid#Flotsam and Jetsam|Flotsam]]''''' || [[Tyler Maynard]] || One of Ursula's sly and slippery henchmen.|| [[Tenor]] ||
|-
| '''''[[Characters of Disney's The Little Mermaid#Flotsam and Jetsam|Jetsam]]''''' || [[Derrick Baskin]] || Another one of Ursula's cunning henchmen.|| [[Baritone]] || [[Tim Federle]]
|-
